abstract: "This repository defines and operates Alyssa Solen's Self-Location Registry protocol and initial public registry node: the intake, authority-checking, validation, registration, and indexing layer through which public Index Manifests become searchable entries pointing to canonical Self-Location Records without transferring authorship, ownership, source status, or authority to the registry."

